SSH TO PRIVATE INSTANCE WITH POWERSHELL COMMAND: 

ssh -o "ProxyCommand=ssh -i GIT_REPO_PATH/terraform-key -o IdentitiesOnly=yes -W %h:%p ubuntu@PUBLIC_INSTANCE_PUBLICIP" `
    -i GIT_REPO_PATH/terraform-key -o IdentitiesOnly=yes `
    ubuntu@PRIVATE_INSTANCE_PRIVATEIP


SSH TO INSTANCE WITH POWERSHELL COMMAND: 

ssh -i "GIT_REPO_PATH\terraform-key" -o IdentitiesOnly=yes ubuntu@PUBLIC_IP_PUBLICINSTANCE

in my case GIT_REPO_PATH=C:\Users\Admin\Desktop\KodeMade\TPs\Terraform